                <pb facs="0252" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1920v02/pg162"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.918/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé des Affaires in the Dominican Republic</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Brewer</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-16T14:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">January 16,
                                1920—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 17—9:07
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3. Your telegram received today. Military Government issuing Executive order
                    abolishing censorship, and embodying provisions suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brewer</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
